cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below together with the Stone
  Skipping paper (arXiv:2602.11512) listed under references.
type: software
title: "ULDM Eigenmode Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Eigenfunctions f_nl(r) of a soliton potential and spectral coefficients
  c_nlm(t) of ultralight dark matter wavefunctions from PyUL_SK simulations,
  with a local resumable pipeline (uldm-cnlm), the inline recorder used by
  PyUL_SK evolve(Cnlm=True), and scripts that regenerate every figure of
  the Stone Skipping paper from its data deposit.
